# Everything in this repo is stored with LF endings.
# Windows editors and PowerShell redirects rewrite files as CRLF, which turned a
# two-line timestamp change into a 787-line phantom diff on 2026-09-06. This
# normalizes on the way in so that never happens again.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
# overseer 10-20: generated by tools/progress.py on every commit; a merge keeps main's copy and the hook regenerates it
tools/progress.json merge=ours
dashboard.html merge=ours
README.md merge=ours
